destruction!\n\n# 50+ Weapons to Unlock\nEndlessly satisfying demolition with tons of epic items, physics toys, and boobytraps.\n{1555781618784552}\n\n# Multiplayer Mayhem with Friends\nWreak havoc with friends in public or private lobbies. Unleash a diabolical beatdown on the buddies (or each other).\n{1597570284565220}\n\n# Tons of Awesome Maps and Game Modes to Explore\nLet your imagination run wild in a playground of topsy-turvy maps and modes. Set up perfectly for combos, trickshots, and chaos!\n{1453827229412242}\n\n# Non-Stop Content Additions\nNew weapons, modes, maps, and more keep the surprises coming and fun constantly evolving!\n\n{903639089201162}\n\n# Join Our Discord!\nFind others to play with, vote on new updates, share your videos (creator programs), and get special access to future releases and giveaways.\n\n**\ud83d\udd17 discord.gg/kyvHv5fYvy**\n\n\nLuxoticVR \u2013 \"One of the best free multiplayer Quest games I've found in a while\"\n\nFudgy \u2013 \"OH MY GOODNESS HIS HEAD ACTUALLY CAME OFF! THAT'S SO COOL!\"", "short_description": "The Ultimate FREE Stress Relief Sandbox with Multiplayer! \n\nYou and your friends can use light-hearted weapons, devices, superpowers and more to beat up on your Buddy ragdoll, earn money, and unlock even more powerful weapons. Every moment is packed with absurd over-the-top destruction!\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "2080 Games, Armored Pig Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.2080.games/privacy/buddy-beatdown", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "2080 Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.2080.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_R